OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely dry with variable cloud
OL,6,Fand bright or sunny spells for many.
OL,7,FThere will be more cloud towards the
OL,8,Fnorthwest, with some light rain and
OL,9,Fdrizzle at times, mainly over the
OL,10,FDerbyshire hills. Feeling warm for
OL,11,Fearly October. Light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FLight rain and drizzle on
OL,14,Fwestern hills easing. Largely dry with
OL,15,Fsome clear spells, allowing for the
OL,16,Fodd mist or fog patch to form in rural
OL,17,Fspots by dawn. Mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
