OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FEarly mist or fog patches
OL,6,Fclearing to give a largely dry and
OL,7,Fbright start to the day. Cloud and
OL,8,Fsome outbreaks of rain will move
OL,9,Fsoutheastwards into the afternoon.
OL,10,FWarm.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FRain,
OL,13,Flocally heavy, gradually clearing
OL,14,Fsoutheast Wednesday. Mostly dry with
OL,15,Fsunny spells Thursday, after a chilly
OL,16,Fstart. A few coastal showers.
OL,17,FBreezier, with rain spreading east
OL,18,FFriday. Temperatures nearer average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
